    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7267" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναπόκρῐτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>unanswered,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ἀποστέλλειν πρέσβεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					4.34.1
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Zeno Stoic.
				1.64
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ἀπελθεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					22.10.13
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναποκρίτως, εἰπών</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antipho
					3.3.2
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				Act.
			, <i>not answering,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰμωγή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					8.23.6
				</span></i>
			.</div>
